{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/extras/5be42e59779d3a58d77727967b8fef2d.avif?t=1759319170\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penny's little ones are lost deep in the mysterious forest, and it's up to you to bring them back home, safe and sound! <i>(Just make sure they're back before dinner!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the forest through all its seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a forest that transforms with the changing seasons. Each bringing new visual beauty and new foes determined to stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soar through the skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold your trusty glider and take a leap of faith! Glide between mountains, over rivers, or just enjoy the thrill of flight. And don't worry, Penny's children have gliders too, so they won't get left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover secrets and treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search high and low for hidden fruits, unlock magical gates with color-coded keys, and uncover the forest's many secrets. Challenge hostile creatures to steal the fruits they guard for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the spirit realm to reveal hidden paths collectables.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2011960?t=1759319170","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2011960?t=1759319170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/37ef75097091c7de5630f56009bac285d5b5393b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759319170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/37ef75097091c7de5630f56009bac285d5b5393b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759319170","categories":[{"